// E2E Trace — Panel 6b: App Gateway Access Log (table, latest 500 rows)
// Data source:  AGWAccessLogs
// Parameters:   {TimeRange} — workbook time-range picker
//
// All requests the gateway received, including those shed before reaching APIM:
// WAF blocks, rate-limit drops, and connection resets.
// Because AGW has no per-request UUID this data is shown separately rather than
// joined to the APIM rows in Panel 6.
//
// How to use alongside Panel 6:
//   A 429/403 here with no matching Corr ID in Panel 6 = gateway rejected it before forwarding.
//   A request in both tables (same time window, same client IP) = successful end-to-end flow.

AGWAccessLogs
| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}
| sort by TimeGenerated desc
| project
    Time         = TimeGenerated,
    ['AGW HTTP'] = HttpStatus,
    ['AGW (ms)'] = round(toreal(TimeTaken) * 1000, 1),
    ['Client IP'] = ClientIp,
    ['URL']       = RequestUri,
    ['Method']    = HttpMethod,
    ['SSL']       = SslEnabled,
    ['User Agent'] = UserAgent
